                        "word": "места́ми"
                    }
                ]
            }
        ],
        "ru-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "cd6e148f-1de5-35d4-9b84-eb28faaccccf",
                "word": "кое-где",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dcf6c435-ad9a-310e-bc02-3bf83dc50828",
                        "entry_id": "cd6e148f-1de5-35d4-9b84-eb28faaccccf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. в некоторых, в немногих местах, местами"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "11309cd2-1de6-4652-8861-a507bf1fec2c",
                                "sense_id": "dcf6c435-ad9a-310e-bc02-3bf83dc50828",
                                "text": "Мшистые стены примыкали к башне; кое-где лепился плющ; искривлённые деревца свешивались с седых бойниц и рухнувших сводов."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "82a23c31-fcc9-4af4-bfcd-6bc09e2665a4",
                                "sense_id": "dcf6c435-ad9a-310e-bc02-3bf83dc50828",
                                "text": "Всё быстренько припив, работяги сказали Марине, что они ещё кое-где помянут Данилу, и ушли."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3ea25f49-a3f2-4e55-93bf-76ba708ff6c6",
                        "source_entry_id": "cd6e148f-1de5-35d4-9b84-eb28faaccccf",
                        "source_sense_id": "dcf6c435-ad9a-310e-bc02-3bf83dc50828",
                        "target_lang_word": "here and there",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "here and there",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a9012c66-f5d7-3725-8708-1f3cd417639b",
                                        "entry_id": "e53b4e82-54f7-3098-ac7b-3ce75316907f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In, at or to various places; in one place and another."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "efd720bf-0e1c-4931-aa51-c377796e2f29",
                                                "sense_id": "a9012c66-f5d7-3725-8708-1f3cd417639b",
                                                "text": "Thus, when he drew up instructions in lawyer language […] his clerks […] understood him very well. If he had written a love letter, or a farce, or a ballade, or a story, no one, either clerks, or friends, or compositors, would have understood anything but a word here and a word there."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ceea0430-467c-43cc-a1a8-8abaca956bf9",
                                                "sense_id": "a9012c66-f5d7-3725-8708-1f3cd417639b",
                                                "text": "They thanked him and bade him good-bye, and turned toward the West, walking over fields of soft grass dotted here and there with daisies and buttercups."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "95aa4014-b384-41cd-bd31-d9ccd1670e1f",
                                                "sense_id": "a9012c66-f5d7-3725-8708-1f3cd417639b",
                                                "text": "Here and there the brilliant rays penetrated to earth, but for the most part they only served to accentuate the Stygian blackness of the jungle's depths."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "202cd5f8-c063-4764-8123-2e71f5b1c787",
                                                "sense_id": "a9012c66-f5d7-3725-8708-1f3cd417639b",
                                                "text": "Although the country branch lines may pass, they leave with those who have known them so well an ineffaceable memory[,] and for those who will follow after[,] a memorial in the form of embankment, cutting and tunnel[,] with here and there a station building or railway cottage that time does not destroy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2acf8fde-08d0-3964-8bba-0db8dddcb9c9",
                                        "entry_id": "e53b4e82-54f7-3098-ac7b-3ce75316907f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "From time to time; intermittently, occasionally."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable",
                                            "uncommon"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "11dc6dab-1199-4e80-82e3-3cff1f093167",
                                                "sense_id": "2acf8fde-08d0-3964-8bba-0db8dddcb9c9",
                                                "text": "Before we study his ideas, it is useful to note here again that extraterrestrial powers intervened here and there in his life, as early as his birth, then his baptism […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec1a8d76-39f8-4ce4-8ccb-6b5bd24f9763",
                                                "sense_id": "2acf8fde-08d0-3964-8bba-0db8dddcb9c9",
                                                "text": "Yep. Since nineteen sixty, or thereabouts. Missed a few years, here and there."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0ddd1545-641d-4b11-ba7d-89639006b386",
                        "source_entry_id": "cd6e148f-1de5-35d4-9b84-eb28faaccccf",
                        "source_sense_id": "dcf6c435-ad9a-310e-bc02-3bf83dc50828",
                        "target_lang_word": "en alguna parte",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
